{
  "_comment": "Agent → Flowise Chatflow mapping. The middleware reads each chatflow_id from the env var named in chatflow_env (set in the main .env). Copy this file to agents.json and customise. Agent IDs are stable and used as URL path segments — do not rename after deployment without migrating session data.",

